[[File:map010.png|center|350px]]'''Castle of Fish''' (アオ・ザ・カナ, ''Ao za Kana'', '''Blue Za Kana''') is the 12th sub-chapter in [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is the 5th sub-chapter in the Stories of Legend and is available up to 3★ difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Just like [[Neverending Cat Story]], this is a simple copy of [[Glucosamine Desert]] with the strength magnification of enemies doubled. The player will be able to easily beat these stages. Even the last one, [[Killer Sardines]], is not a big deal.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

